AlfaCase interactive mockup
==========================

Runtime
-------
The current mockup uses handwritten HTML, CSS, JavaScript, inline SVG icons,
synthetic fixtures and a Python standard-library export helper. No third-party
runtime library, downloaded font, external image, LLM, AI service or dataset is
bundled or contacted by the mockup. System fonts are supplied by the browser/OS.

Simulated integrations and data
------------------------------
Alfa-Bank / Alfa-Business names refer to the challenge context. The bank shell,
user, company profiles, relationship signals, news, research comments, quotes,
role selection and agent traces are demonstrations, not real bank integrations.
All fixture entities and content are synthetic. User-entered text is unverified.
Actual supplied Alfa-Bank research and competition datasets are not included.
The mockup does not attribute its synthetic analysis to a real bank position.

Development validation tools (not bundled)
-----------------------------------------
Chromium was used for browser validation and screenshots.
Puppeteer Core 25.14.0 (Apache-2.0) was used by the optional browser smoke runner.
Mermaid 11.17.2 (MIT) was used to validate documentation diagrams.
These tools are not loaded by the product pages or the self-contained HTML file.

The supplied challenge PDF defines the intended approved-model list and data
sources. Update these notices with the actual dependencies, model/provider,
dataset provenance and relevant licenses as the full prototype is implemented.
